  "name": "spin-rs",
  "description": "A low-level Rust synchronization library providing spin-based primitives including Mutex, RwLock, and Once. Architected for efficiency in no_std and bare-metal environments, it leverages atomic operations and hardware-specific relaxation instructions to provide thread safety without requiring operating system scheduler support.",
